ssault Rifle Aiming/Firing- Look down your sights while you take down hordes of the undead<br></li><li>Crafting- Scavenge for filament to craft ammo and upgrade weapons<br></li><li>Physics Based Environments- Break through glass with your hands or push objects away, and hands will not go through them<br></li><li>Interactive and Immersive Gameplay - Combat, scaling/climbing, and engaging puzzles<br></li><li>Full locomotion- Traverse through various environments using full locomotion with smooth touchpad/stick walking to freely roam, scavenge, and explore<br></li><li>Optimized to run fluidly on GTX 970 or equivalent</li></ul>","developers":["Five Finger Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594220/4f38f980f9fca26b8d28c14094ff9fe3e3fee1d3/header.jpg?t=1747633519","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2018 Five Finger Studios LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/594220/447483/02ca29410a9365c95976b448b9775220d2fb83fa/1751107455/dash_av1.mpd?t=1648334951","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/594220/447483/02ca29410a9365c95976b448b9775220d2fb83fa/1751107455/dash_h264.mpd?t=1648334951","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/594220/447483/02ca29410a9365c95976b448b9775220d2fb83fa/1751107455/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1648334951","id":256878126,"name":"The Living Remain | Official Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/